{"reference":"Jeremiah 36","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":36,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A Written Message Heard by Many Voices","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"This chapter follows the message through several stages: Jeremiah dictates it, Baruch writes it and reads it publicly, officials hear and report it, the king has it read and destroys it, and Baruch writes a replacement scroll with additional material. The account also shifts among divine speech, Jeremiah's words, Baruch's scribal work, narration, and the speech of officials and king. These changing voices make the chapter a narrative about both the warning itself and the different ways people receive it.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 36:1-32"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_036_0e0cd2c803967efdefcd94fb"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Larger Book of Jeremiah","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"The received book of Jeremiah contains varied forms of writing, including poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. Its present form reflects a long compositional and textual history. A practical outline places chapter 1 at the beginning; chapters 2–25 together; 26–29; 30–33; 34–45; 46–51; and chapter 52 at the close, without deciding how the book was composed.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 10:1-25","Jeremiah 11:1-23","Jeremiah 12:1-17","Jeremiah 13:1-27","Jeremiah 14:1-22","Jeremiah 15:1-21","Jeremiah 16:1-21","Jeremiah 17:1-27","Jeremiah 18:1-23","Jeremiah 19:1-15","Jeremiah 1:1-19","Jeremiah 20:1-18","Jeremiah 21:1-14","Jeremiah 22:1-30","Jeremiah 23:1-40","Jeremiah 24:1-10","Jeremiah 25:1-38","Jeremiah 26:1-24","Jeremiah 27:1-22","Jeremiah 28:1-17","Jeremiah 29:1-32","Jeremiah 2:1-37","Jeremiah 30:1-24","Jeremiah 31:1-40","Jeremiah 32:1-44","Jeremiah 33:1-26","Jeremiah 34:1-22","Jeremiah 35:1-19","Jeremiah 37:1-21","Jeremiah 38:1-28","Jeremiah 39:1-18","Jeremiah 3:1-25","Jeremiah 40:1-16","Jeremiah 41:1-18","Jeremiah 42:1-22","Jeremiah 43:1-13","Jeremiah 44:1-30","Jeremiah 45:1-5","Jeremiah 46:1-28","Jeremiah 47:1-7","Jeremiah 48:1-47","Jeremiah 49:1-39","Jeremiah 4:1-31","Jeremiah 50:1-46","Jeremiah 51:1-64","Jeremiah 52:1-34","Jeremiah 5:1-31","Jeremiah 6:1-30","Jeremiah 7:1-34","Jeremiah 8:1-22","Jeremiah 9:1-26"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_036_b2b0341868e31e6bb61d7193"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}